# B4: the SimpleUML to RDB sample of org.eclipse.m2m.qvt.oml.samples

case b4_uml2rdb_pim
kind bench
qvto reference/eclipse-qvto/plugins/org.eclipse.m2m.qvt.oml.samples/projects/org.eclipse.m2m.qvt.oml.samples.simpleuml2rdb/Simpleuml_To_Rdb.qvto
in reference/eclipse-qvto/plugins/org.eclipse.m2m.qvt.oml.samples/projects/org.eclipse.m2m.qvt.oml.samples.simpleuml2rdb/pim.simpleuml
bench group B4
bench note the sample's own model
end

